1
00:00:00,260 --> 00:00:04,180
67² dikurangi 33².

2
00:00:04,180 --> 00:00:05,890
Bisa jawab dalam 2 detik?

3
00:00:05,890 --> 00:00:07,630
Budi pakai cara biasa:

4
00:00:07,630 --> 00:00:10,820
kuadratkan satu per satu, lalu dikurangkan.

5
00:00:10,820 --> 00:00:14,240
30 detik, belum selesai juga!

6
00:00:14,240 --> 00:00:17,890
Padahal ada rumus SMP yang bisa jadi jalan pintas:

7
00:00:17,890 --> 00:00:24,370
a² − b² = (a + b)(a − b).

8
00:00:24,370 --> 00:00:27,280
Artinya, cukup jumlahkan dan kurangkan.

9
00:00:27,280 --> 00:00:30,480
67 + 33 = 100.

10
00:00:30,480 --> 00:00:33,790
67 − 33 = 34.

11
00:00:33,790 --> 00:00:37,830
100 × 34… 3400!

12
00:00:37,830 --> 00:00:39,710
Simpan dulu, biar nggak lupa.

13
00:00:39,710 --> 00:00:44,100
Coba lagi: 75² − 25².

14
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:46,710
Jumlahnya 100, selisihnya 50.

15
00:00:46,710 --> 00:00:49,320
100 × 50 = 5000!

16
00:00:49,320 --> 00:00:50,580
Tapi hati-hati.

17
00:00:50,580 --> 00:00:53,480
Jangan dikurangkan dulu, lalu dikuadratkan.

18
00:00:53,480 --> 00:00:57,410
34² = 1156. Salah!

19
00:00:57,410 --> 00:00:59,810
Yang benar tetap 3400.

20
00:00:59,810 --> 00:01:03,030
Kenapa bisa? Dari persegi sisi 67,

21
00:01:03,030 --> 00:01:05,330
potong persegi sisi 33.

22
00:01:05,330 --> 00:01:09,810
Sisanya dipindah… jadi persegi panjang 100 × 34.

23
00:01:09,810 --> 00:01:12,800
Dan kini, Budi juga bisa dalam 2 detik.

24
00:01:12,800 --> 00:01:17,540
Sekarang giliranmu: 58² − 42².

25
00:01:17,540 --> 00:01:19,320
Tulis angkanya saja di komentar!

26
00:01:19,320 --> 00:01:22,410
Follow untuk trik hitung cepat lainnya!
